<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87791" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προκῑν-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>move forward,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ στῖφος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					1.4.21
				</span></i>
			; <i>urge on,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵππον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					9.3
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>come on, advance,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				1.4.23
			</span></i>; <i>dance before</i> the eyes, of specks, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Loc.Hom.</u>
				3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>excite</i> or <i>begin before,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν μάχην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					17.19
				</span></i>
			 (nisi leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προκρίνειν</span>).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>excite</i> or <i>arouse before,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν τοῦ νέου ψυχήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.36d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν πόλιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>BJ</u>
					4.4.7
				</span></i>
			.</div>
